<title>PHILIPPINES: Davao Union six-mth net almost doubles.</title>
<headline>Davao Union six-mth net almost doubles.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31.</p>
<p>			  (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			1,416 vs 905.544</p>
<p>    Net income		  205.922 vs 105.815</p>
<p>Note: Full name Davao Union Cement Corp.</p>
